WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:05.220
For a pop culture icon, Jedi Master Yoda is
still a pretty mysterious figure.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.880
From his shadowy origins to the real meaning
behind his final moments with Luke Skywalker,

00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:12.000
this is Yoda's story explained.

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:16.810
Linguists have had some interesting conversations
on the subject of Yoda's speech pattern.

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:18.560
Talk the way he does, why?

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:22.880
His backwards way of communicating has left
researchers baffled, and that might be the

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:24.380
way George Lucas likes it.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:29.150
The creator of Star Wars was notoriously shifty
when it came to any information involving

00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:30.860
Yoda's species and homeworld.

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:35.680
There are others of his kind, like Yaddle,
who became Jedi, or the as-yet unnamed child

00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:40.180
in The Mandalorian, but Lucas has never so
much as whispered the name of Yoda's species.

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:44.690
He's even joked that Yoda is the illegitimate
child of Kermit the Frog and Miss Piggy.

00:00:45.180 --> 00:00:52.580
"To be really honest with you, I never even
figured out where he came from, what his species

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:54.040
is called, it doesn't even have a name."

00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:59.640
Before Yaddle's creation, Lucas discouraged
anyone from making more beings like Yoda,

00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:03.260
suggesting that he perhaps wanted Yoda to
be the only one of his kind.

00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:07.720
While that ship has sailed now, the story
of his species is still wrapped in mystery.

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:08.560
Who knows?

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:11.280
Maybe his species really is descended from
the Muppets.

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:17.140
In the non-canonical Star Wars Expanded Universe,
now known as Legends, we got the closest thing

00:01:17.150 --> 00:01:21.180
to a true origin story for Yoda that we're
ever likely to get.

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:25.320
In Legends, before Yoda was a Jedi Master,
he had a Jedi Master himself.

00:01:25.420 --> 00:01:29.860
Centuries before the events of the films,
Yoda and a human friend crash-landed on a

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:30.640
swamp world.

00:01:30.780 --> 00:01:36.080
There, they found Jedi Master N'Kata Del Gormo,
a member of the Hysalrian species.

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:40.380
Del Gormo told the two that they were Force-sensitive
and trained them as his Padawans.

00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:44.820
Eventually, Yoda went to Coruscant to continue
his training at the Jedi Temple.

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:49.670
There, Yoda was trained by Huyang, a Mark
IV architect droid professor, who also made

00:01:49.670 --> 00:01:52.460
a canonical appearance in The Clone Wars TV
series.

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:55.740
Once Yoda had his own lightsaber, he was paired
with a mentor.

00:01:55.900 --> 00:02:00.820
Some fans have theorized that Del Gormo returned
to Coruscant to complete Yoda's training,

00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:03.660
but the truth is that the lore gets kind of
murky here.

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:08.520
In Legends, Yoda's early time as a Jedi Master
was influenced by a story he learned about

00:02:08.530 --> 00:02:10.959
the Jedi Masters K'ungfu and Chuang.

00:02:10.959 --> 00:02:15.510
When Chuang died, his apprentice celebrated,
saying that death is just a way that people

00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:17.320
become a different part of the Force.

00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:20.660
At the age of 100, Yoda became a Jedi Master.

00:02:20.760 --> 00:02:25.560
He was surprisingly young and spry at the
time if we consider that he only became geriatric

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:27.220
at the ripe old age of 900.

00:02:27.489 --> 00:02:32.060
Those 800 years as a Jedi Master gave him
a lot of time to pass on his own knowledge,

00:02:32.060 --> 00:02:35.400
a role that Yoda became extremely comfortable
with over the years.

00:02:35.560 --> 00:02:40.080
Apparently, around 20,000 starry-eyed younglings
called Yoda their "Master."

00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:41.760
That's a whole lot of Padawans.

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:44.720
"You knew Master Yoda?"

00:02:44.940 --> 00:02:50.620
"Yes, he taught nearly all the younglings
in the temple at one point or another."

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:54.880
Having trained so many Jedi, Yoda became a
well-respected member of the Jedi Order.

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:59.580
At some point in his very long tenure, he
was honored with a seat on the Jedi High Council.

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:03.960
Made up of 12 members, the council ruled over
the entirety of the Jedi Order.

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:07.420
Not all of Yoda's Padawans became exemplary
Jedi.

00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:10.739
Yoda's very last Padawan was a human man called
Dooku.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:15.060
Before he became the villain we know in the
prequel films, Dooku was Yoda's pupil.

00:03:15.140 --> 00:03:19.940
As Yoda's student, Dooku was impressed with
his master but not entirely sold on the rules

00:03:19.950 --> 00:03:20.950
of the Jedi Order.

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:25.499
Dooku was also something of a political idealist,
and after witnessing the corruption of the

00:03:25.499 --> 00:03:30.139
Galactic Senate and struggling with the Jedi
Code, he abandoned his rank of Jedi Master

00:03:30.139 --> 00:03:31.660
and returned to his home planet.

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:35.880
Home for Dooku was the planet Serenno, where
he reclaimed his royal-ish heritage.

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:40.020
This is how he became Count Dooku, serving
as the head of state for the Confederacy of

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:42.180
Independent Systems during the Clone Wars.

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:45.800
What was kept on the down-low was that he
had a new master: Darth Sidious.

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:47.820
Dooku had fallen to the dark side.

00:03:48.420 --> 00:03:52.860
During our first encounter with Yoda in The
Empire Strikes Back, he seemed like an eccentric,

00:03:52.860 --> 00:03:55.230
cranky, and incredibly wise creature.

00:03:55.230 --> 00:03:59.380
However, in his heyday, Yoda was much more
physical in how he solved problems.

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:02.860
There was a reason why he was so revered,
and it wasn't just because he was quick to

00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:05.060
dole out deep, merchandisable quotes.

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:08.300
"Do or do not.

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:10.440
There is no try."

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:15.620
Yoda was very close with the Wookiee race
during his lifetime, having served as an honored

00:04:15.629 --> 00:04:19.060
negotiator between the big furry guys and
their neighbors, the Trandoshans.

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:22.979
He likely earned the Wookiees' trust when
he and his young Padawan, Dooku, came to the

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:25.479
Wookiee homeworld of Kashyyyk to do some pest
control.

00:04:25.720 --> 00:04:30.580
At the time, the planet was full of massive,
rampaging monsters known as Terentateks.

00:04:30.590 --> 00:04:34.810
These venomous creatures craved the blood
of the Force-sensitive, meaning the Terentateks

00:04:34.810 --> 00:04:37.760
probably must have seen Yoda as a frog-shaped
delicacy.

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:42.300
This, and his negotiation efforts, earned
him the title of Defender of the Home Tree.

00:04:42.940 --> 00:04:45.280
Has any other Jedi trained as many younglings?

00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:48.699
Has any other Jedi served the Order so dutifully
for so long?

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:51.280
Could any other Jedi prove to be so measured
and wise?

00:04:51.320 --> 00:04:55.540
Yoda made such a name for himself that he
was the obvious choice when it came to appointing

00:04:55.540 --> 00:05:00.600
the Grand Master of the Jedi Council, a title
only given to the oldest and wisest of Jedi.

00:05:00.740 --> 00:05:05.040
Yoda was the Grand Master when Naboo was invaded,
which means he was the head honcho when a

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:09.640
small and slightly sassy Anakin Skywalker
was presented as the possible Chosen One.

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:14.880
Yoda told him how fear can lead to the Dark
Side, foreshadowing Anakin's eventual descent.

00:05:14.889 --> 00:05:19.020
As Grand Master, Yoda had a lot of difficult
decisions to make as the Clone Wars fell upon

00:05:19.020 --> 00:05:21.880
the galaxy, but he was first and foremost
a teacher.

00:05:22.060 --> 00:05:26.520
He assigned a Padawan named Ahsoka Tano to
Anakin in order to help the Jedi Knight to

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:28.640
get over his fears of losing loved ones.

00:05:28.789 --> 00:05:33.160
Obviously, it didn't quite work out for Anakin
himself, but Ahsoka seems to have done alright

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:33.660
from it.

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:38.500
In addition to his royal title, Dooku served
as the head of state of the Confederacy of

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:39.720
Independent Systems.

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:43.840
This essentially made him the leader of the
Separatist movement that fought against the

00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:46.500
Republic and the Jedi Order during the Clone
Wars.

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:50.440
Yoda would get to face his former Padawan
head-on when he and a strike team went to

00:05:50.440 --> 00:05:55.620
rescue Obi-Wan Kenobi and Anakin Skywalker,
who were defeated and captured by Dooku.

00:05:55.740 --> 00:05:59.860
Despite Count Dooku claiming that the Dark
Side had allowed him to become more powerful

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:04.500
than any Jedi, Yoda quickly proved that his
power was much greater than his diminutive

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:05.540
size suggested.

00:06:05.600 --> 00:06:10.160
Yoda hobbled in with a cane, but he turned
Dooku's Force lightning against him with ease.

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:14.160
When lightsabers were drawn, it was clear
that Yoda was still the master in this fight.

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:19.700
Dooku only escaped because he distracted Yoda
by nearly squashing Anakin and Obi-Wan, allowing

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:23.660
the former padawan the chance to jump on a
ship and fly away from his old master.

00:06:24.140 --> 00:06:27.160
Toward the end of the Clone Wars, Yoda began
to hear voices.

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:32.080
Some council members wondered if the old Jedi
was going senile when Yoda appeared distracted

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:32.940
during a meeting.

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:37.380
As it turns out, Yoda was just wondering how
Qui-Gon Jinn could've contacted him from beyond

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:40.740
the grave, as he had during an earlier meditation
session.

00:06:40.840 --> 00:06:45.380
This was unheard of, and the other Council
members were unable to hear anything or anyone

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:46.380
while meditating.

00:06:46.440 --> 00:06:50.660
This led Yoda to undergo a procedure that
would bring him as close to death, and the

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:51.400
Force, as possible.

00:06:51.400 --> 00:06:55.760
Inches away from dying, Yoda heard Jinn again,
who told him to go to Dagobah.

00:06:55.770 --> 00:07:00.009
On Dagobah, Yoda was led to a cave strong
with the Dark Side, where he saw a vision

00:07:00.009 --> 00:07:01.760
of a Sith Lord slaughtering Jedi.

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:07.240
Having seen this horrible future, Qui-Gon
Jinn directed Yoda to the Wellspring of Life,

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:08.250
home of the midi-chlorians.

00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:12.620
There, Yoda met with a Force priestess who
would help him to achieve life after death.

00:07:12.840 --> 00:07:17.940
First, Yoda was forced to fight a sharp-toothed
shadow-version of himself, his Dark Side motivated

00:07:17.940 --> 00:07:18.720
by hubris.

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:22.280
He was only able to defeat his wraith when
he accepted that he did have a Dark Side,

00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:24.790
but that it was a part that he refused to
give into.

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:28.889
He went on to undergo some trippy vision training
in order to learn how to appear as a Force

00:07:28.889 --> 00:07:30.800
spirit after his eventual death.

00:07:31.080 --> 00:07:35.100
This ordeal had him fighting evil opponents
on the original homeworld of the Sith, and

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:38.100
nearly being tricked by the illusions of some
of his dead friends.

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:43.400
Before the Empire raised its ugly head, the
Jedi Council wasn't entirely comfortable with

00:07:43.409 --> 00:07:46.169
Chancellor Palpatine's growing power in the
galaxy.

00:07:46.169 --> 00:07:50.569
That made things even more uncomfortable when
Palpatine appointed Anakin Skywalker to be

00:07:50.569 --> 00:07:52.379
his representative at the Council.

00:07:52.379 --> 00:07:57.819
Thanks to some Sith-level manipulations and
creepy visions of Padme Amidala dying in childbirth,

00:07:57.819 --> 00:08:02.479
this relationship between Anakin and Palpatine
led to the creation of Darth Vader, the Sith

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:04.759
Lord that Yoda had feared would come in the
future.

00:08:04.980 --> 00:08:10.400
As Jedi were being slaughtered under Palpatine's
Order 66, Yoda and Obi-Wan conspired to take

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:14.500
down Darth Sidious and Darth Vader, who were
actually Palpatine and Anakin.

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:19.120
At the Galactic Senate, Yoda faced off with
the yellow-eyed Emperor Palpatine and found

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:21.480
his opponent was super-charged with Force
lightning.

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:25.840
At first, they seemed evenly matched, but
eventually Palpatine gained the upper hand.

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:28.700
Yoda knew he was defeated and fled for his
life.

00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:33.180
Upon defeat, Yoda placed himself into exile,
believing that he had failed.

00:08:33.460 --> 00:08:37.100
Before he ran off to Dagobah, he witnessed
the birth of Luke and Leia and the death of

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:37.740
Padme.

00:08:37.920 --> 00:08:42.000
Sensing the twins' connection to the Force,
Yoda helped come up with the plan to separate

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:42.960
and hide the babies.

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:47.060
Yoda also planned on training with the Force
spirit of Qui-Gon Jinn, and he passed the

00:08:47.060 --> 00:08:49.460
knowledge Qui-Gon gave him on to Obi-Wan Kenobi.

00:08:49.560 --> 00:08:54.160
Because of this, Obi-Wan used his time hiding
out on Tatooine to also learn how to maintain

00:08:54.170 --> 00:08:58.639
his identity after death, which meant that
like Jinn and Yoda, he would be able to pass

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:00.540
on wisdom long after he was gone.

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:04.860
While Obi-Wan made himself comfortable on
the sandy desert planet, Yoda made the swampy

00:09:04.860 --> 00:09:06.280
world of Dagobah his home.

00:09:06.380 --> 00:09:10.080
He made a modest house there among all the
little creatures of the muck, waiting for

00:09:10.089 --> 00:09:13.540
the Skywalker twins to grow up and inevitably
cause trouble.

00:09:13.540 --> 00:09:17.370
Though he was physically stuck on the planet,
Yoda was still able to keep an eye on surviving

00:09:17.370 --> 00:09:21.740
Jedi throughout the galaxy, helping them to
avoid the Inquisitors that sought to snuff

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:22.240
them out.

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:27.200
Around two decades after Yoda's defeat at
the hands of Palpatine, a grown-up Luke Skywalker

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:32.300
came to Dagobah in search of a great warrior,
the Jedi who had taught his own mentor, Obi-Wan

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:32.800
Kenobi.

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:36.480
He found Yoda, who didn't appear to be much
more than a senile hermit.

00:09:36.480 --> 00:09:39.420
But soon, Luke would find out that Yoda was
the stuff of legend.

00:09:39.580 --> 00:09:44.240
Despite his cryptic speech pattern, Yoda proved
to be an excellent teacher as he mentored

00:09:44.240 --> 00:09:45.400
Luke in the ways of the Force.

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:47.820
However, their relationship had its ups and
downs.

00:09:47.960 --> 00:09:52.280
During his training, Luke ignored Yoda's advice
and went to confront Vader when he sensed

00:09:52.290 --> 00:09:53.510
his friends were in danger.

00:09:53.510 --> 00:09:58.050
He didn't return to Dagobah until a year later,
when he found Yoda ill and dying.

00:09:58.050 --> 00:10:02.220
With Yoda gone, Luke would become the last
of the Jedi, so Yoda asked him to pass on

00:10:02.220 --> 00:10:06.120
what he knew to others and become a mentor
as Yoda had been for centuries.

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:08.620
Upon his death, Yoda became one with the Force.

00:10:08.780 --> 00:10:12.200
But he wasn't gone for good, because no one's
ever really gone in Star Wars.

00:10:12.280 --> 00:10:15.380
His training to maintain his identity after
death also helped.

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:20.279
Yoda appeared one last time, years later when
Luke was at his lowest during his own exile.

00:10:20.279 --> 00:10:25.070
In classic Yoda fashion, he dispensed some
necessary wisdom to one of his students, restoring

00:10:25.070 --> 00:10:28.680
Luke's faith in the Force when he, and the
galaxy, needed it most.

